  "source_discretization": "Integrate the frozen bilinear surface exactly into each solver cell using the existing thin cell_projection_matrix on both planar axes. Multiply by exact exponential vertical cell averages. Do not sample then renormalize. Cell averages supply the finite-difference/FV RHS; convergence must be tested for every new source.",
