    "test_mond_atlas_force_sampling"
  ],
  "independent_controls": [
    "Independent piecewise-linear cell quadrature, source mass/positivity/unit scaling, subdivision and subcell spike tests",
    "Analytic anisotropic polynomial Poisson and spherical Plummer Newton/QUMOND force",
    "Dense versus disk-backed full-domain Poisson and nonlinear face flux",
    "Force sampler manufactured fields and rectangular projector CPU/GPU controls"
