  "limitations": [
    "Finite heights are illustrative; thin sheet h=0 is excluded from this finite-volume adapter.",
    "Four cases cross source refinement factors 1/4 and stellar heights .1/.4 kpc; gas height remains .2 kpc. Full height changes include different fitted planar coefficients, so this is joint deprojection sensitivity.",
    "Native beam, signed source-noise, missing phase, distance, registration and conversion uncertainties remain. All previous source residuals and their nonnegative floor remain relevant.",
    "Numerical box changes do not validate the physical isolated exterior; one-at-a-time refinements do not bound joint cross terms.",
    "Vectors and force-equivalent summaries are conditional mathematical fields, not circular orbit predictions in asymmetric matter.",
    "All declared cases and failed numerical gates are retained; no model is picked based on a gravity response."
  ]
